how.pseudocode:
# 输入: n 顶点，adj[u] 出边表，normal=True 表示无法移动者输（反常则取反初始）
outdeg[u] = len(adj[u]); 反图 radj
state[u] = 0 (未定), 1 (W), -1 (L)
queue ← 所有 outdeg==0 的 u，state[u] = -1 (无法移动者输，正常规则)
while queue:
  u = pop()
  for v in radj[u]:
    if state[v] != 0: continue
    if state[u] == -1:
      state[v] = 1; queue.push(v)
    else:
      outdeg[v] -= 1
      if outdeg[v] == 0:
        state[v] = -1; queue.push(v)
剩余 state==0 的顶点 → 平局 D
